{"seq":11,"slug":"writing-thinking-frameworks","title":"写作思维与框架","stage":"DONE","category":"writing","chapterCount":5,"docCount":20,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/writing-thinking-frameworks","rating":{"composite":3.77,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.77,"verdict":"consider","uScore":4}},"introMarkdown":"# 写作思维与框架 简介\n\n写作的质量最终取决于思维的质量。华丽的辞藻无法掩盖逻辑的混乱，再好的文笔也拯救不了结构的崩塌。思维框架是写作的骨架，它决定了文章的论证是否有力、结构是否清晰、信息是否有效地传递给读者。掌握系统化的写作思维方法，是从\"能写\"到\"写好\"的核心飞跃。\n\n本知识库面向希望提升写作深度和结构化能力的写作者，尤其适合需要撰写分析性文章、商业报告、技术方案和长篇内容的从业者。如果你经常面临\"有话说不清\"\"文章缺乏说服力\"或\"长文写到一半失控\"等困境，本知识库将为你提供系统性的解决方案。\n\n第一章**逻辑思维**夯实写作的推理基础，涵盖演绎推理与归纳推理的核心方法、批判性思维在写作中的应用以及论证图谱的构建，帮助你让每一个观点都有坚实的逻辑支撑。第二章**结构框架**介绍经过实践验证的写作组织模型，包括金字塔原理、SCQA框架、问题-解决模式和比较-对比模式，让你面对任何写作任务都能快速搭建起清晰的文章骨架。第三章**说明策略**深入探讨解释与阐述的技术，从定义与分类、过程分析到因果分析，掌握将复杂概念讲清楚的系统方法。第四章**长文策略**专门解决长篇写作的结构挑战，涵盖书籍架构设计、报告体系搭建、系列文章规划和章节衔接技巧，帮助你驾驭万字以上的大型写作项目。第五章**短文策略**聚焦于短小精悍的写作形式，探讨微型文章、图片说明文字、推文与推文串以及电梯演讲稿的写作方法，在有限的篇幅中实现最大的信息传递效率。\n\n建议从第一章逻辑思维开始，这是所有框架和策略的底层能力。在具备逻辑基础后进入第二章学习结构框架，掌握快速组织文章的实用工具。第三章的说明策略可以根据实际写作需要选择性学习。如果你的工作以长篇内容为主，优先深入第四章；如果你更多面对社交媒体和短内容场景，则可以先学习第五章。无论哪种路径，都建议在学习每个框架后立即用真实的写作任务加以实践。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"logical-thinking","title":"逻辑思维","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/writing-thinking-frameworks/logical-thinking","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"deductive-reasoning","title":"演绎推理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/writing-thinking-frameworks/logical-thinking/deductive-reasoning"},{"seq":2,"slug":"inductive-reasoning","title":"归纳推理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/writing-thinking-frameworks/logical-thinking/inductive-reasoning"},{"seq":3,"slug":"critical-thinking-in-writing","title":"写作中的批判性思维","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/writing-thinking-frameworks/logical-thinking/critical-thinking-in-writing"},{"seq":4,"slug":"argument-mapping","title":"论证图谱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/writing-thinking-frameworks/logical-thinking/argument-mapping"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"structural-frameworks","title":"结构框架","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/writing-thinking-frameworks/structural-frameworks","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pyramid-principle","title":"金字塔原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/writing-thinking-frameworks/structural-frameworks/pyramid-principle"},{"seq":2,"slug":"scqa-framework","title":"SCQA 框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/writing-thinking-frameworks/structural-frameworks/scqa-framework"},{"seq":3,"slug":"problem-solution-pattern","title":"问题-解决模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/writing-thinking-frameworks/structural-frameworks/problem-solution-pattern"},{"seq":4,"slug":"compare-contrast-pattern","title":"比较-对比模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/writing-thinking-frameworks/structural-frameworks/compare-contrast-pattern"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"expository-strategies","title":"说明策略","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/writing-thinking-frameworks/expository-strategies","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"explanation-techniques","title":"解释技巧","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/writing-thinking-frameworks/expository-strategies/explanation-techniques"},{"seq":2,"slug":"definition-and-classification","title":"定义与分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/writing-thinking-frameworks/expository-strategies/definition-and-classification"},{"seq":3,"slug":"process-analysis","title":"过程分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/writing-thinking-frameworks/expository-strategies/process-analysis"},{"seq":4,"slug":"cause-and-effect","title":"因果分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/writing-thinking-frameworks/expository-strategies/cause-and-effect"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"long-form-strategies","title":"长文策略","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/writing-thinking-frameworks/long-form-strategies","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"book-structure-design","title":"书籍结构设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/writing-thinking-frameworks/long-form-strategies/book-structure-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"report-architecture","